<title>UK: Spintab sets $125 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Spintab sets $125 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AB SPINTAB</p>
<p> AMT    $125 MLN	COUPON     6.875     MATURITY    28.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.1325  PAY DATE    28.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.945    SPREAD	+23 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT FEB 2000 U.S TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
